,"w":0.20276041666666678,"h":0.018212564680608168,"t":"General Training Writing"},{"t":"2 tasks","c":1,"h":0.014695591322603119,"x":0.72837370352076691,"y":0.2834149755093186,"w":0.057093423207600913},{"t":"60 minutes","y":0.30187093226846429,"h":0.015160134157323646,"c":1,"w":0.092279491424560489,"x":0.71246041549988892},{"x":0.51384083023458837,"w":0.07785467147827152,"y":0.33284883726192183,"t":"Speaking","h":0.015988371937820545,"c":1},{"t":"11 to 14 minutes","x":0.48615917052519136,"y":0.3516445068376568,"w":0.13494809468587238,"h":0.013296011196641033,"c":1},{"w":0.22145329793294266,"y":0.38226744162117221,"c":1,"t":"Total (Maximum) Test Time","x":0.44117646512306163,"h":0.014534884186538477},{"t":"2 hours 44 minutes","x":0.47404844259049334,"h":0.013112926416417148,"y":0.40116279081145456,"c":1,"w":0.15570934295654298},{"y":0.45486354076028723,"w":0.27681660970052085,"h":0.017520180442601951,"c":1,"t":"ACADEMIC TEST FORMAT","x":0.19031141822932435},{"t":"Listening","y":0.48961597816124036,"c":1,"x":0.19079688463771338,"w":0.08907911300659177,"h":0.024322539129984722},{"y":0.51886369367049845,"w":0.70253580729166676,"t":"This test consists of four parts, each with ten questions. The first two parts are concerned","x":0.19025151709884797,"h":0.020359272219402258,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.53724444474494792,"t":"with social needs. The first part is a conversation between two speakers and the second","x":0.1902601901096968,"h":0.019371383752415872,"w":0.69214655558268223},{"y":0.5566829953625384,"t":"part is a monologue. The final two parts are concerned with situations related to","w":0.63321797688802084,"h":0.016095171448565537,"c":1,"x":0.19031142671001683},{"y":0.5740747156523679,"t":"educational or training contexts. The third part is a conversation between up to four","x":0.19026731792849005,"h":0.019120466634057642,"w":0.6644476826985678,"c":1},{"x":0.19017704278041511,"c":1,"w":0.34460685729980467,"h":0.019868406238382375,"y":0.59193717978918092,"t":"people and the fourth part is a monologue."},{"x":0.20923991840403175,"y":0.60992016871000199,"t":"A variety of question types is used, including: multiple choice, matching, plan\/map\/","w":0.65935302734375001,"c":1,"h":0.02175244891284811},{"h":0.018995028096032929,"c":1,"y":0.62936046513646016,"t":"diagram labelling, form completion, note completion, table completion, flowchart","w":0.64705881754557293,"x":0.19031142130914483},{"w":0.66795740763346356,"c":1,"t":"completion, summary completion, sentence completion and short-answer questions.","y":0.64802488026207117,"x":0.19024561513100025,"h":0.019560045758855282},{"c":1,"h":0.020449135835726273,"y":0.66565638797623494,"t":"Candidates hear the recording once only and answer the questions as they listen. Ten","w":0.67487360636393234,"x":0.20754586916148998},{"x":0.19031142534263013,"t":"minutes are allowed at the end for candidates to transfer their answers to the answer","w":0.67128026326497381,"h":0.015988371937820545,"y":0.68459302333047622,"c":1},{"h":0.015230517857887316,"x":0.18838194758181401,"y":0.70235484881828325,"t":"sheet.","w":0.054263718922932941,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.080626125335693355,"h":0.023442510627549096,"x":0.18906693790598217,"t":"Reading","y":0.73027453784092256},{"h":0.020852038207965107,"y":0.75862362841298181,"c":1,"t":"This test consists of three sections with 40 questions. There are three texts, which are","x":0.18849313813400623,"w":0.67146423339843742},{"c":1,"x":0.18852676155892217,"w":0.71462748209635407,"y":0.77747138241233804,"t":"taken from journals, books, magazines and newspapers. The texts are on topics of general","h":0.0204254728334613},{"h":0.017592396746155536,"t":"interest. At least one text contains detailed logical argument.","y":0.79636109190130189,"x":0.18685122178526531,"w":0.48788925170898439,"c":1},{"t":"A variety of question types is used, including: multiple choice, identifying information","h":0.023421717991438551,"c":1,"w":0.67324803670247402,"x":0.20748863973242873,"y":0.81220256423800274},{"y":0.83159824664989301,"c":1,"x":0.18851690400157423,"w":0.70948262532552087,"h":0.021875430187868639,"t":"(True\/False\/Not Given), identifying the writer's views\/claims (Yes\/No\/Not Given), matching"},{"t":"information, matching headings, matching features, matching sentence endings, sentence","w":0.70775278727213542,"h":0.02038268095300777,"c":1,"x":0.18849981514654132,"y":0.85126346742394154},{"x":0.18858131512441531,"y":0.87053883851605873,"h":0.018996045170671216,"c":1,"t":"completion, summary completion, note completion, table completion, flowchart completion,","w":0.72318339029947909},{"w":0.4325259399414062,"t":"diagram-label completion and short-answer questions.","y":0.88803358967395929,"h":0.017494751574527734,"c":1,"x":0.18858132103275702},{"w":0.010380622545878126,"x":0.89965397929799529,"t":"5","y":0.9534883720536681,"c":1,"h":0.013081395100512871}],"w":2400,"h":2857}